{
  "name": "Referral payout runner (2026-08-14)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "months",
              "triggerAtDayOfMonth": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "referral-payout-runner-trigger",
      "name": "Monthly close",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Intake",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "referral-payout-runner-fetch",
      "name": "Read the intake sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "complete",
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Extract the fields the article names. Absent means null, never a default. Dates come back as strings in a stated format.\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "referral-payout-runner-model",
      "name": "Read one referral",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "referral-payout-runner-calc",
      "name": "Creates a referral, stamps the rule version, checks self-r",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.route }}",
                    "rightValue": "Not qualifying",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Not qualifying"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.route }}",
                    "rightValue": "Wait",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Wait"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.route }}",
                    "rightValue": "Not payable",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Not payable"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.route }}",
                    "rightValue": "Held",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Held"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "Continue"
        }
      },
      "id": "referral-payout-runner-branch",
      "name": "Meets the condition?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Events",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "referral-payout-runner-store-0",
      "name": "Append to events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1140,
        130
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Rules",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "referral-payout-runner-store-1",
      "name": "Append to rules",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1140,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "operations@example.com",
        "subject": "=Referral payout runner: run complete",
        "message": "=See the appended rows.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "referral-payout-runner-mail",
      "name": "Send the result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1400,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 700,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "## Referral payout runner\n\nNative n8n port of a /build series.\nSource: https://www.allanninal.dev/build/series/referral-payout-runner/\n\n### Where the AWS design maps to n8n\n\n| The article | Here |\n|---|---|\n| S3 document inbox | Google Sheets intake |\n| Bedrock, one read per referral | OpenAI node |\n| DynamoDB tables | Google Sheets tabs |\n| SES | Gmail |\n| Lambda | this workflow |\n\nSwap any of them: Airtable or Postgres for the sheets, SMTP for Gmail, Anthropic for OpenAI. The shape is the point, not the vendor.\n\n### What does not survive the port\n\nPer-step IAM, the cost argument in part 6, and append-only writes with condition expressions. See the README."
      },
      "id": "referral-payout-runner-note",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -220
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
